    "step-q96005": {
      "key": "step-q96005",
      "question": {
        "dom_id": "step-q96005",
        "name": "Question 9",
        "problem": "$\\int (\\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{coth}⁡\\theta )\\text{d}\\theta =$",
        "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}\\theta }(\\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta )=-\\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta \\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =-\\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta +C,\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}\\theta }(\\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta )=-\\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{coth}⁡\\theta \\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{coth}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =-\\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta +C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{coth}⁡\\theta )\\text{d}\\theta  & =\\int \\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta +\\int \\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{coth}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta +C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "calculator_instructions": "",
        "fields": [
          {
            "key": "selection",
            "type": "radio",
            "choices": [
              {
                "option": "a",
                "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-96005-a",
                "type": "math",
                "value": "{sech}^{2}⁡\\theta +{csch}^{2}⁡\\theta +C",
                "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"76\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c68\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.421em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c68\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.421em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sech</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>csch</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>    "
              },
              {
                "option": "b",
                "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-96005-b",
