      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "The derivatives of −sech θ and −csch θ are sech θ tanh θ and csch θ coth θ, respectively. Integrating term by term gives −sech θ −csch θ + C, option e. No captured answer or grade establishes Math Academy's key for this question.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
