        "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199688/observations/step-q96023-0f508a626413d443a556.html",
        "screenshot": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199688/observations/step-q96023-0f508a626413d443a556.png",
        "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x & \\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x)={sech}^{2}⁡x & \\,⇒\\,\\int {sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ({sech}^{2}⁡x-2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int (-2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-2\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x-2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "can_dont_know": false,
        "can_skip": false,
        "question": {
          "dom_id": "step-q96023",
          "name": "Question 13",
          "problem": "$\\int ({sech}^{2}⁡x-2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$",
          "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x & \\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x)={sech}^{2}⁡x & \\,⇒\\,\\int {sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ({sech}^{2}⁡x-2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int (-2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-2\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x-2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          "calculator_instructions": "",
          "fields": [
