    "step-q96020": {
      "key": "step-q96020",
      "question": {
        "dom_id": "step-q96020",
        "name": "Question 14",
        "problem": "$\\int \\operatorname{sech}⁡y(5\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y-\\operatorname{sech}⁡y)\\text{d}y=$",
        "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{sech}⁡y)=-\\operatorname{sech}⁡y\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y & \\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{sech}⁡y\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y=-\\operatorname{sech}⁡y+C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y)={sech}^{2}⁡y & \\,⇒\\,\\int {sech}^{2}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y=\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sech}⁡y(5\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y-\\operatorname{sech}⁡y)\\text{d}y & =\\int (5\\operatorname{sech}⁡y\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y-{sech}^{2}⁡y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =5\\int \\operatorname{sech}⁡y\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y-\\int {sech}^{2}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-5\\operatorname{sech}⁡y-\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "calculator_instructions": "",
        "fields": [
          {
            "key": "selection",
            "type": "radio",
            "choices": [
              {
                "option": "a",
                "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-96020-a",
                "type": "math",
                "value": "5\\operatorname{sech}⁡y-\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y+C",
                "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"120\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c68\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c68\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>sech</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>tanh</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>  "
              },
              {
