      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "Expanding gives 5 sech y tanh y − sech² y. Since the derivatives of sech y and tanh y are −sech y tanh y and sech² y, respectively, the integral is −5 sech y − tanh y + C, option d. No captured answer or grade establishes Math Academy's key for this question.",
        "confidence": 1,
