61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJSZ2-222B\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1111,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-63\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-73\" x=\"945\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-68\" x=\"1339\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"3173\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-64\" x=\"3913\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"4469\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"5319\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6376,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-73\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-69\" x=\"394\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-6E\" x=\"673\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-68\" x=\"1229\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"8328\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"9123\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"10124\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"10884\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Similarly, by considering the derivative of the hyperbolic cosine, we have</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"59.377ex\" height=\"5.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1508.9 25564.9 2515.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\t\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d }{\\textrm d x}(\\cosh x) = \\sinh{x} \\qquad\\Rightarrow\\qquad \\int \\sinh x\\  \\textrm{d}x = \\cosh x + C.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-64\" d=\"M376 495Q376 511 376 535T377 568Q377 