      ],
      "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199688/observations/step-e8341-0f696976a6d8f3537bdc.html",
      "screenshot": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199688/observations/step-e8341-0f696976a6d8f3537bdc.png",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d t}(\\sinh t) = \\cosh{t} \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad  \\int \\cosh{t} \\, \\textrm dt = \\sinh{t} + C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 8\\operatorname{cosh}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=8\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=8\\operatorname{sinh}⁡t+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "can_dont_know": false,
      "can_skip": false,
      "question": {
        "dom_id": "step-e8341",
        "name": "Example: Integrating the Hyperbolic Sine and the Hyperbolic Cosine",
        "problem": "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nCalculate $\\displaystyle \\int 8\\cosh t \\,\\textrm{d}t.$",
        "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d t}(\\sinh t) = \\cosh{t} \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad  \\int \\cosh{t} \\, \\textrm dt = \\sinh{t} + C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 8\\operatorname{cosh}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=8\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=8\\operatorname{sinh}⁡t+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "calculator_instructions": "",
        "fields": [],
        "problem_field_keys": [],
        "answer_fields_complete": null,
        "result": null,
        "proof_feedback": null,
        "html": "<div id=\"step-e8341\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Integrating the Hyperbolic Sine and the Hyperbolic Cosine</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e8341\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n 