      "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199688/observations/step-q95254-56d49552f4ea56647bf1.html",
      "screenshot": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199688/observations/step-q95254-56d49552f4ea56647bf1.png",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =2\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "can_dont_know": false,
      "can_skip": false,
      "question": {
        "dom_id": "step-q95254",
        "name": "Question 1",
        "problem": "$$\n\n$\\int 2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$",
        "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =2\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
