      "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199688/observations/step-q96018-0d61ae8c4c3daf6c1e99.html",
      "screenshot": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14199688/observations/step-q96018-0d61ae8c4c3daf6c1e99.png",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}w}(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡w)={sech}^{2}⁡w\\,⇒\\,\\int {sech}^{2}⁡w\\,\\text{d}w=\\operatorname{tanh}⁡w+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (3+2{sech}^{2}⁡w)\\,\\text{d}w & =\\int 3\\,\\text{d}w+\\int 2{sech}^{2}⁡w\\,\\text{d}w \\\\  & =3\\int \\,\\text{d}w+2\\int {sech}^{2}⁡w\\,\\text{d}w \\\\  & =3w+2\\operatorname{tanh}⁡w+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "can_dont_know": false,
      "can_skip": false,
      "question": {
        "dom_id": "step-q96018",
        "name": "Question 11",
        "problem": "$$\n\n$\\int (3+2{sech}^{2}⁡w)\\,\\text{d}w=$",
        "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}w}(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡w)={sech}^{2}⁡w\\,⇒\\,\\int {sech}^{2}⁡w\\,\\text{d}w=\\operatorname{tanh}⁡w+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (3+2{sech}^{2}⁡w)\\,\\text{d}w & =\\int 3\\,\\text{d}w+\\int 2{sech}^{2}⁡w\\,\\text{d}w \\\\  & =3\\int \\,\\text{d}w+2\\int {sech}^{2}⁡w\\,\\text{d}w \\\\  & =3w+2\\operatorname{tanh}⁡w+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
