on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>csch</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sinh</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 3:57 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:14</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>"
