      {
        "dom_id": "step-31162",
        "name": "Example: \n                    Integrating the Square of the Hyperbolic Secant",
        "problem": "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\n$\\displaystyle \\int 6\\sech^2 x \\,\\textrm{d}x =$",
        "worked_solution": "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nRecall that\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\tanh x) = \\sech^2{x} \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad  \\int \\sech^2{x} \\, \\textrm dx = \\tanh{x} + C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 6{sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=6\\int {sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=6\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "calculator_instructions": "",
