></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect height=\"60\" stroke=\"none\" width=\"1249\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<use x=\"346\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-64\" y=\"676\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-716)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-64\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"556\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n<use x=\"1489\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-28\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1878,0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-73\"></use>\n<use x=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-69\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"673\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-6E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1229\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-68\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<use x=\"3831\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"4403\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-29\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"5070\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-3D\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6127,0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-63\"></use>\n<use x=\"444\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-6F\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"945\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-73\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1339\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-68\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<use x=\"8189\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Since integration is the reverse of differentiation, we have</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"5.676ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -1437.2 11163.2 2443.8\" width=\"25.927ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n\\int \\cosh{x}\\,\\textrm d x = \\sinh{x} + C.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M114 -798Q132 -824 165 -824H167Q195 -824 223 -764T275 -600T320 -391T362 -164Q365 -143 367 -133Q439 292 523 655T645 1127Q651 1145 6