r\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJSZ2-222B\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1111,0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-63\"></use>\n<use x=\"444\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-6F\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"945\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-73\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1339\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-68\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<use x=\"3173\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-78\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"3913\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-64\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"4469\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-78\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"5319\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-3D\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6376,0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-73\"></use>\n<use x=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-69\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"673\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-6E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1229\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-68\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<use x=\"8328\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-78\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"9123\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2B\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"10124\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"10884\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Similarly, by considering the derivative of the hyperbolic cosine, we have</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"5.843ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -1508.9 25564.9 2515.6\" width=\"59.377ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\t\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d }{\\textrm d x}(\\cosh x) = \\sinh{x} \\qquad\\Rightarrow\\qquad \\int \\sinh x\\  \\textrm{d}x = \\cosh x + C.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M376 495Q376 511 376 535T377 568Q377 613 367 624T316 637H298V660Q298 683 300 683L310 684Q320 685 339 686T376 688Q393 689 413 690T443 693T454 694H457V390Q457 84 458 81Q461 61 472 55T517 46H535V0Q533 0 459 -5T380 -11H